0 Name: cadence-geneva.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/cadence-geneva.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Cadence design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Stock parts, one input motor, four-slot Geneva indexer, friction dwell and twelve-position dial.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: cadence-geneva.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Friction-dwell clockwork demonstration; physical build and timekeeping accuracy untested.
